* @title Host stlimit option caps a runaway loop
* @options {"stlimit": 2}
* @match error
* @expect LIMIT ON STATEMENT EXECUTION EXCEEDED
* @nonstandard the stlimit host option has no CSNOBOL4 equivalent
* The LT ceiling is a safety net: if stlimit is not applied the loop exits
* normally at I=1000, so a regression fails the assertion instead of hanging.
LOOP    I = I + 1
        LT(I, 1000)                                             :S(LOOP)
END
